-- TEST INCLUDE (never run on its own: it is \ir'd right after `begin;` inside a rolled-back transaction).
-- The redactor tests of this directory exercise the redaction ENGINE (strict / light) on columns such as tasks.result and agent_runs.summary. Since round 5 the production spec exports those
-- columns BLANK, so these tests put the previous (pre-blanking) classification in place for the length of their transaction. backup_free_text_check.sql tests the PRODUCTION spec.
